---
// The three platform marks, defined once per page and referenced per post with
// <use href="#si-…">. Not a sprite FILE and not an icon font — the same
// document, so nothing is fetched and the CSP (`img-src 'self'`,
// `script-src 'self'`) stays exactly as narrow as it is. With 96 posts the
// alternative was the same three paths inlined ~288 times.
//
// TRADEMARKS. Each mark is the platform's own, drawn as its published
// geometry, unaltered in shape or proportion, and rendered in ONE colour via
// currentColor — the monochrome treatment all three brand guidelines allow
// (X: black or white only; Meta's Facebook and Threads: the blue/branded
// version OR all-white/all-black). Nothing is recoloured into the site's
// carmine, nothing is rotated, outlined, or put inside a container it does not
// come with, and no mark appears without the platform's name beside it — so
// none of them reads as an endorsement of this site.
---
